        <TR>
          <TD class=3D"labelCell">Custodian:</TD>
          <TD>Department of Environment, Land, Water &amp; =
Planning</TD></TR>
        <TR>
          <TD class=3D"labelCell">Abstract:</TD>
          <TD>Victorian Land Cover provides a consistent through time,=20
            whole-of-state, spatial land cover data set for 7 epochs =
(1987-1990,=20
            1990-1995, 1995-2000, 2000-2005, 2005-2010, 2010-2015 and =
2015-19).=20
            The dataset uses Landsat satellite imagery and local =
calibration (or=20
            training) data. The most likely layers (one for each epoch) =
classify=20
            each pixel in to one of 19 land cover classes. The dataset =
provides=20
            additional evidence for use alongside other South Australian =
mapping=20
            products to measure and map native and non-native land cover =
types=20
            (although land cover types delineated are different between=20
          States).</TD></TR>
